{"2870790": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Dumpster Gang", "steam_appid": 2870790, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a gang of mischievous raccoons in this chaotic co-op sandbox for 1-4 players. Complete ridiculous missions, steal everything you can carry, and outsmart a relentless Exterminator determined to throw your gang behind bars. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870790/extras/121b63fd66b03bb7e62e0dcb15e49696.avif?t=1787769443\" width=1280 height=120 /></span>Live the raccoon dream. Knock over trash cans, steal shiny junk, raid snacks, commit tiny crimes, and unleash your inner menace. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870790/extras/7e76784ac0b40a5fdba051152c19f51d.poster.avif?t=1787769443\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870790/extras/7e76784ac0b40a5fdba051152c19f51d.webm?t=1787769443\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870790/extras/7e76784ac0b40a5fdba051152c19f51d.mp4?t=1787769443\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870790/extras/ec73d7834d4003bd58384c6409199f7d.avif?t=1787769443\" width=1280 height=120 /></span>Sprint, climb walls, crawl through vents, and reach places only a raccoon could. Pick up, throw, steal, or smash nearly everything you find and turn every level into your own chaotic playground. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870790/extras/16ab4bdad5951d11c4a3a494e0f9d09b.poster.avif?t=1787769443\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870790/extras/16ab4bdad5951d11c4a3a494e0f9d09b.webm?t=1787769443\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870790/extras/16ab4bdad5951d11c4a3a494e0f9d09b.mp4?t=1787769443\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870790/extras/28d5dadd84389d029a1af844f1bb5e3d.avif?t=1787769443\" width=1280 height=120 /></span>Play solo or with friends. Work together to carry heavy loot, solve puzzles, and rescue captured teammates... but things never go according to plan. Betrayals, disasters, and hilarious accidents are all part of the job. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870790/extras/644defc3d1659fb55e3e65a5cf767398.poster.avif?t=1787769443\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870790/extras/644defc3d1659fb55e3e65a5cf767398.webm?t=1787769443\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870790/extras/644defc3d1659fb55e3e65a5cf767398.mp4?t=1787769443\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870790/extras/87f9ff675cff51f1f8f726027524376f.avif?t=1787769443\" width=1280 height=120 /></span>Cause enough chaos and the Exterminator will hunt you down. Outsmart his traps, escape capture, and rescue your friends before your gang ends up behind bars.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870790/extras/613c393647653b29e3d4be3b2e3529e3.poster.avif?t=1787769443\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870790/extras/613c393647653b29e3d4be3b2e3529e3.webm?t=1787769443\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870790/extras/613c393647653b29e3d4be3b2e3529e3.mp4?t=1787769443\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870790/extras/6ea64b1d049c6663f04f388fd5b69867.avif?t=1787769443\" width=1280 height=120 /></span>Return home after every mission to customize your raccoon, unlock hats with unique abilities, and decorate your hideout with every ridiculous item you've stolen. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870790/extras/24a41cf7bba7d914c7aba003cc2cd97d.poster.avif?t=1787769443\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870790/extras/24a41cf7bba7d914c7aba003cc2cd97d.webm?t=1787769443\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870790/extras/24a41cf7bba7d914c7aba003cc2cd97d.mp4?t=1787769443\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a gang of mischievous raccoons in this chaotic co-op sandbox for 1-4 players. Complete ridiculous missions, steal everything you can carry, and outsmart a relentless Exterminator determined to throw your gang behind bars. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870790/extras/121b63fd66b03bb7e62e0dcb15e49696.avif?t=1787769443\" width=1280 height=120 /></span>Live the raccoon dream. Knock over trash cans, steal shiny junk, raid snacks, commit tiny crimes, and unleash your inner menace. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870790/extras/7e76784ac0b40a5fdba051152c19f51d.poster.avif?t=1787769443\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870790/extras/7e76784ac0b40a5fdba051152c19f51d.webm?t=1787769443\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870790/extras/7e76784ac0b40a5fdba051152c19f51d.mp4?t=1787769443\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870790/extras/ec73d7834d4003bd58384c6409199f7d.avif?t=1787769443\" width=1280 height=120 /></span>Sprint, climb walls, crawl through vents, and reach places only a raccoon could. Pick up, throw, steal, or smash nearly everything you find and turn every level into your own chaotic playground. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870790/extras/16ab4bdad5951d11c4a3a494e0f9d09b.poster.avif?t=1787769443\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870790/extras/16ab4bdad5951d11c4a3a